      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds so cold when you put it like that. but i guess it's hard to argue with the logic. if there's no inherent value to continuing, isn't choosing when it ends just the ultimate way to actually have control over your own life? like, instead of just letting time happen to you, you're making a deliberate choice.",
